<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT INDIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT INDIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PRIBRAM, Czech Republic 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic clinched a place in the second round of the Davis Cup on Sunday when Jiri Novak beat Mahesh Bhupathi to give them a 3-2 victory in their World Group tie.</p>
<p>Results: (Czech names first)</p>
<p>Petr Korda beat Leander Paes 5-7 6-3 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Jiri Novak beat Mahesh Bhupathi 6-1 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Czech Republic win tie 3-2.</p>
</text>
